      },
      "articles": [
        {
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "title": "为什么能够持续，不代表已经能够扩展",
          "summary": "连续解决的是运行能否继续；扩展解决的是运行能否跨越当前尺度。数量增长只有改变了承载、连接与协调方式，才真正成为尺度扩展。",
          "href": "/articles/book4-article-001",
          "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-001-ZH-HANS-ARTICLE"
        },
        {
          "locale": "en",
          "title": "Why Continuity Does Not Automatically Mean Expansion",
          "summary": "Continuity asks whether a runtime can keep going. Expansion asks whether it can cross its current scale boundary. Growth becomes real scale expansion only when carrying, connection, and coordination change with it.",
          "href": "/articles/book4-article-001",
          "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-001-EN-ARTICLE"
        }
      ],
      "summaryScope": "PUBLISHED_ARTICLE_SUMMARY_NOT_NEW_CANONICAL_DEFINITION",
      "humanAcceptanceComplete": false
    },
