      "articles": [
        {
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "title": "为什么当前尺度会逼迫运行寻找更大的组织方式",
          "summary": "当能力、资源、需求与连接持续超过旧结构能够吸收的范围，扩展压力就会出现；复杂度梯度进一步把负担集中到关键接口，迫使运行通过分层、网络、模块与标准寻找新的组织尺度。",
          "href": "/articles/book4-article-009",
          "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-009-ZH-HANS-ARTICLE"
        },
        {
          "locale": "en",
          "title": "Why the Current Scale Pushes a Runtime Toward a Larger Organizational Form",
          "summary": "Expansion pressure appears when accumulated capabilities, resources, demands, and connections can no longer be absorbed by the old structure. A complexity gradient then concentrates burdens at critical interfaces, pushing the runtime toward new layers, networks, modules, and standards.",
          "href": "/articles/book4-article-009",
          "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-009-EN-ARTICLE"
        }
      ],
      "summaryScope": "PUBLISHED_ARTICLE_SUMMARY_NOT_NEW_CANONICAL_DEFINITION",
      "humanAcceptanceComplete": false
    },
